# NOTE: the package-local receipt store (packages/*/.zfa/) is tracked on
# purpose. Pub refuses to publish a file that is tracked and git-ignored at
# the same time, so those receipts are either tracked or ignored — never
# both. They are excluded from the published archive by .pubignore.
